[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_SERVE_THE_CHAINS]
Break the Chains

[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_SERVE_THE_CHAINS_desc]
The time has come, the evidence is conclusive, and the preparation is complete...\n\nIt’s time to embark on the journey, the first step to liberate all of Equestria. Let’s sweep away the darkness of Manehattan and fight for the freedom of the ponies!

[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_SERVE_THE_CHAINS_TOOLTIP]
§RGet rid of the shackles, and break the chains§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_SERVE_THE_CHAINS]
斩断锁链

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_SERVE_THE_CHAINS_desc]
时机已经成熟，证据确凿，准备充分...\n\n是时候踏上征程，踏上解放全小马利亚的第一步了。让我们扫除马哈顿的黑暗，为小马们的自由而战！

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_SERVE_THE_CHAINS_TOOLTIP]
§R挣脱枷锁，斩断锁链§!

